      <td>1</td>
      <td><strong>Identity &amp; Access Control (M1)</strong></td>
      <td>
        • Email/phone signup &amp; password authentication (<code>/auth/signup</code>, <code>/auth/login</code>)<br/>
        • OTP request &amp; verification workflow (<code>/auth/request-otp</code>, <code>/auth/verify-otp</code>)<br/>
        • JWT bearer token sessions, refresh endpoint, &amp; user language preferences (English / Urdu)<br/>
        • 5-role RBAC enforcement (<code>customer</code>, <code>kitchen_staff</code>, <code>service_staff</code>, <code>cashier</code>, <code>manager</code>)<br/>
        • Multi-tenant <code>restaurant_id</code> isolation &amp; staff action audit log (<code>/auth/audit-logs</code>)
