        • Categorized dish browsing with food photography, prep times, &amp; dietary badges (Halal, Spicy, Veg)<br/>
        • Structured dish modifiers (spice level, portion size, extras/add-ons, removal notes)<br/>
        • Live menu CRUD APIs &amp; instant 86'ing (availability toggle) synced across clients
      </td>
