      <td><strong>Order Lifecycle &amp; Cloud Deployment (M5)</strong></td>
      <td>
        • Server-enforced Order State Machine (<code>NEW → CONFIRMED → PREPARING → READY → DISPATCHED / CANCELLED</code>)<br/>
        • Live Customer Order Status Tracker view (<code>/order/[orderId]</code>) without manual reload<br/>
        • Production Vercel frontend deployment (<code>mez-flow.vercel.app</code>) &amp; Next.js <code>/api/v1</code> proxy rewrites<br/>
        • Serverless cold-start mitigation: 45s client timeout, automatic background retry, &amp; silent <code>/health</code> warmup
      </td>
      <td>2380227</td>
      <td>Sheikh Muhammad Khizar</td>
    </tr>
